6.1 Objective Function

\max_\pi \; \mathbb{E}_q\left[ U(y_T) - \lambda_c \sum_t c(a_t) - \lambda_e E(y_T, y^*) \right], \quad \text{s.t.} \sum_t c(a_t) \le B_{\max}

6.2 Value of Computation

(As defined in §4.3.2.)

6.3 Conformal Calibration

Delivers guarantee: \mathbb{P}(\mathrm{correct} \mid C \ge 1-\tau_\alpha) \ge 1-\alpha.

6.4 Regret Bound

Proof sketch mapping to StageRoute’s \tilde{\mathcal{O}}(T^{2/3}) for budget‑constrained linear contextual bandit.

6.5 IB‑EDL Likelihood

Dirichlet \text{Dir}(\mathbf{p} \mid \alpha_1, \alpha_0); mutual information term I(Z;X) minimised to suppress spurious evidence.

