7. Algorithmic Specifications

Full pseudocode is in Appendix G of the main paper. Here we summarise the production control loop.

```
FUNCTION ACB_Orchestrate(q, B_max, α, u_max, δ_min, T_max)
    B_rem ← B_max
    y ← FastLLM(q)
    C, u ← ConfidenceEstimator(q, y)          // cascade
    FOR t = 0 TO T_max-1:
        IF C ≥ 1-τ_α AND u < u_max THEN RETURN y
        feasible ← {a: cost[a] ≤ B_rem}
        IF feasible empty THEN RETURN y
        a* ← argmax_{a∈feasible} VoC(a)
        IF VoC(a*) ≤ 0 THEN RETURN y
        y_new, cost ← Execute(a*, q, y)
        B_rem ← B_rem - cost
        C_new, u_new ← ConfidenceEstimator(q, y_new)
        IF |C_new - C| < δ_min THEN RETURN y_new
        C, u, y ← C_new, u_new, y_new
    RETURN y
```

ConfidenceEstimator:

```
FUNCTION ConfidenceEstimator(q, y)
    H_ent ← avg token entropy
    C_ent ← 1 - H_ent/H_max
    IF C_ent ≥ τ_high OR C_ent ≤ τ_low THEN
        RETURN C_ent, 0.01
    α1, α0 ← IB_EDL_Critic(q, y)
    C ← α1/(α1+α0)
    u ← 2/(α1+α0)
    RETURN C, u
```

