11. Performance Metrics & Evaluation

11.1 System‑Level KPIs

· Token reduction vs static pipeline: ≥ 30% (target per H1).
· Hallucination reduction (extrinsic): ≥ 40% relative to single‑pass (target per H2a).
· Latency overhead: < 5% p50 over fast‑path for simple queries; < 300 ms for full cascade.
· Energy savings: 40–60% vs static multi‑agent (target).

11.2 Quality Metrics

· Accuracy: within 2% of static pipeline.
· Conformal coverage: P(\text{correct} \mid \text{accepted}) \ge 0.95.
· ECE: ≤ 0.03 after IB‑EDL.

11.3 Operational Metrics

· Availability: 99.9% on gate and critic.
· Budget compliance: ≥ 95% of queries within token budget.

