12. Security & Reliability

· Data privacy: queries anonymised; no long‑term storage of answers.
· Adversarial robustness: adversary‑hardened calibration set; gate overrides when epistemic uncertainty high.
· Fail‑safe: all failures fall back to fast‑path answer with warning.
· Rate limiting: per‑user token budget enforced; anomaly detection for abusive queries.


